at the teeth of giant predators in a dark clinic while avoiding their deadly aggression. Balance tactics, luck, and limited resources to heal your patient without losing your own life.","steam_appid":3423280,"support_info":{"email":"support@alicegamesfze.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Russian, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}